    sa_faq_q1: "Can I change my plan mid-way?",
    sa_faq_a1: "Yes, you can upgrade to a higher plan at any time. The remaining period is taken into account and the payment difference is refunded or carried over.",
    sa_faq_q2: "Is there a trial period?",
    sa_faq_a2: "Yes — all plans include a 14-day free trial. No credit card required. You can fully test the system and then make your decision.",
    sa_faq_q3: "How many employees can work on one plan?",
    sa_faq_a3: "The number of employees is unlimited — you can add as many chefs, waiters, and admins as you like. The plan only limits the number of restaurants (branches).",
    sa_faq_q4: "Is my data secure?",
    sa_faq_a4: "Yes. All data is stored in Google Firebase. Firebase uses anonymous authentication, HTTPS encryption, and real-time security rules. An admin can only access their own restaurant's data.",
    sa_faq_q5: "Do the Chef and Waiter panels work on all plans?",
    sa_faq_a5: "Yes, all three panels (admin.js, chef.js, waiter.js) are available on all plans. The difference is only in advanced features — for example, the Start plan lacks TV mode, Stop-list, CRM, and deep analytics.",
