    landing_faq_q1: "How long does it take to launch the system?",
    landing_faq_a1: "Once restaurant data, the menu, and staff are entered, the system is fully up and running within a few hours. The superadmin team helps with setup.",
    landing_faq_q2: "What happens if the internet goes down?",
    landing_faq_a2: "Since staff work on a local Wi-Fi network, in-restaurant processes (ordering, kitchen) continue almost without interruption. Only actions requiring external internet (a customer's mobile order) depend on the connection.",
    landing_faq_q3: "Can it be used for multiple branches?",
    landing_faq_a3: "Yes, each branch connects to the system as a separate restaurant, and all branches can be monitored from the superadmin panel.",
    landing_faq_q4: "Can staff permissions be restricted?",
    landing_faq_a4: "Yes, the admin can set individual permissions for each staff member (chef, waiter). Everyone sees only their own section.",
    landing_faq_q5: "Which payment systems are supported?",
    landing_faq_a5: "Cash, card, Click, and Payme payments are all supported. Fast checkout via Kassa Code is also available.",
    landing_faq_q6: "Which languages does the system support?",
    landing_faq_a6: "Uzbek, Russian, and English — every part of the interface, including the menu, buttons, and notifications, is translated into all three languages.",
    landing_faq_q7: "Is my data secure?",
    landing_faq_a7: "Each restaurant has its own isolated data environment and cannot access other restaurants' data. Firebase Realtime Database security rules are applied.",
    landing_faq_q8: "Can I change my plan later?",
    landing_faq_a8: "Yes, you can upgrade or downgrade at any time. The price difference is calculated accordingly, and the superadmin team will help.",
